change_device_order.description:
The order the devices are tracked and shown in the Event Log. Select a device to move it up one position, then save the new order.

Nothing is saved until you choose ✓ Save. Closing with ✕ discards changes.

{header_msg}

dashboard_builder.description:
Create or update an iCloud3 dashboard for up to 4 tracked devices. Change it later with the HA dashboard tools or use it as it is. Rebuilding a dashboard replaces the changes you made to it in HA.

{db_icons}

{header_msg}

exclude_sensors.description:
Select the sensors of specific devices that should not be created, for example the battery sensor of one device.

{excluded_msg}

{filter_msg}

Nothing is saved until you choose ✓ Save. Closing with ✕ discards changes.

display_text_as.description:
Replace private text in the Event Log, such as an email address. For example, show gary@email.com instead of the real address.

Select a replacement to change or remove it, then save. Nothing is saved until you choose ✓ Save. Closing with ✕ discards changes.

{header_msg}

